OL,3,ABurnham arrives in Ukraine with plans
OL,4,Ato hand over UK blueprints for
OL,5,Along-range missiles
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham is in Kyiv for his first
OL,8,Fforeign visit since becoming UK prime
OL,9,Fminister last month
OL,11,FAs well as chairing his first meeting
OL,12,Fof the "coalition of the willing", the
OL,13,FPM is set to hand over blueprints so
OL,14,FUkraine can build its own long-range
OL,15,Fmissiles
OL,17,FThe visit comes on Ukraine's
OL,18,Findependence day and after Moscow last
OL,19,Fweek warned of "consequences" over the
OL,20,Fuse of British drones by Ukraine
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
